# Phase 14: secrets and private artifacts never enter an image. The Dockerfiles COPY whole directories (apps/api, ownus), so a local .env file
# used to be copied into the image layers; only the *.example templates are kept.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example
